{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Stats don't lie.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The protagonist has given up being an adventurer and become a detective.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >An incident occurs at a bar he happens to stop by!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;Detectives in this world can peek into the stats of others.&quot;</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use these words to solve the case!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><u>Overview</u></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is a first-person mystery adventure in which you investigate cases while monitoring the stat screen.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use stats and deduction to uncover the truth.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In the <strong>main story</strong>, you unravel the mystery of a strange incident that took place in &quot;Omland,&quot; a parallel world ruled by stats.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Completing the main story unlocks the following substories.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Extra</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A sequel to the main story.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Another Episode</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take on a new incident that takes place in the real world.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><u>Play Mode</u></strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>Easy</i></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The number of choices is reduced.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>Normal</i></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Standard mode.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>Hard</i></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can take on the &quot;Challenge to the Reader.&quot;</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This mode requires a broad perspective and deep reasoning.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><u>Play Time</u></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >2 hours</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hard Mode will take longer.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><u>Multiplayer Mode</u></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Invite online friends to join the game and enjoy the story together.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The host handles all basic operations, but all players can individually view logs and investigation materials.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Work together to uncover the truth.</p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"\u672c\u7de8\u30af\u30ea\u30a2","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3956170/aca33abd775335dad8bce6b644270b707b591eb6.jpg"},{"name":"\u8b0e\u30ab\u30fc\u30c9\u30b3\u30f3\u30d7\u30ea\u30fc\u30c8","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3956170/4b43a2e7d4452f7767cbabc339e586caa7ed93b2.jpg"},{"name":"\u5168\u30b7\u30ca\u30ea\u30aa\u30af\u30ea\u30a2","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3956170/ec8e7d128217f7efead3d737d17fe991cf8f1098.jpg"}],"total":3},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3956170?t=1761242174","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3956170?t=1761242174","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3956170/8c1af758b4c1d1fdb75ccbb44df7f762f24fb696/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1761242174","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3956170/8c1af758b4c1d1fdb75ccbb44df7f762f24fb696/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1761242174","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"Online Co-op","id":38},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Adjustable Difficulty","id":78}